('config', 'high', 'Application fails to start: missing SECRET_KEY', 'The application refuses to start in production, raising a RuntimeError that SECRET_KEY is not set. It works locally where a default is present.', 'The production environment did not define the SECRET_KEY environment variable, and the app had no safe fallback.', 'Documented the required env var and added a clear startup error instructing operators to set SECRET_KEY.', 'flask/config.py', NOW() - INTERVAL '143 days', 50),
('config', 'critical', 'Database connection refused on port 5432', 'The app cannot connect to PostgreSQL, reporting ''connection refused'' on port 5432. The database container is running but unreachable.', 'The database host was configured as ''localhost'' inside a container where the DB is on a separate service hostname.', 'Updated the DATABASE_URL host to the Docker service name instead of localhost.', 'flask/config.py', NOW() - INTERVAL '343 days', 65),
('config', 'critical', 'Static files return 404 in production', 'CSS and JS files load correctly in development but return 404 in production, leaving the site unstyled.', 'The static file root path was hardcoded to a development directory that does not exist in the production image.', 'Made the static path configurable via an env var and set it correctly per environment.', 'flask/config.py', NOW() - INTERVAL '249 days', 70),
('config', 'critical', 'CORS blocks legitimate frontend requests', 'The frontend cannot call the API because the browser blocks the requests due to missing CORS headers.', 'The allowed-origins configuration did not include the production frontend domain.', 'Added the frontend domain to the CORS allowed origins configuration.', 'flask/config.py', NOW() - INTERVAL '110 days', 45),
('config', 'medium', 'Debug mode accidentally enabled in production', 'The production deployment is running with debug mode on, exposing stack traces to end users, a security concern.', 'The DEBUG flag defaulted to True and was not overridden in the production configuration.', 'Set DEBUG=False by default and required explicit opt-in via env var for development only.', 'flask/config.py', NOW() - INTERVAL '277 days', 40),
('config', 'high', 'Wrong log level floods disk with debug logs', 'A configuration problem was reported: wrong log level floods disk with debug logs. The application behaves incorrectly in the affected environment due to an environment or settings misconfiguration rather than a code defect.', 'Root cause was an incorrect configuration value related to ''wrong log level floods disk with debug logs'' in the environment settings.', 'Corrected the configuration value, documented the correct setting in .env.example, and verified across environments.', 'flask/config.py', NOW() - INTERVAL '68 days', 66),
